# Local documentation and client collateral.
# --- Documentation: private by default, published by explicit allow-list ------
# `/docs/` holds the evidence package, internal specs and operator runbooks. This
# repository is PUBLIC, and those files carry real tenant identifiers, real
# balances, production hostnames and an inventory of open security weaknesses —
# so the default is ignore, and each publishable file is re-included by name.
#
# Adding a file here PUBLISHES it. Before adding one, confirm it names no tenant
# (BK-/OR- codes other than the BK-SAMP0001 / OR-DEM00001 test fixtures), no
# balance, no hostname or role name, and no unremediated security gap.
# Classification and per-file reasoning: docs/audit/ (private).
/docs/**
!/docs/**/

# Public contracts and integration guides
!/docs/API_INTEGRATION.md
!/docs/BOG_ONBOARDING.md
!/docs/DASHBOARD_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md
!/docs/sso-onboarding.md
!/docs/sdi_onboarding_runbook.md

# Domain specifications
!/docs/ai_engine.md
!/docs/data_engine.md
!/docs/market_data_adapter.md
!/docs/rbac.md
!/docs/regulatory_reporting.md
!/docs/stress.md
!/docs/attestation_esignature.md

# BoG return framework: the committed layouts ARE the official structures, and
# the line maps are how a reviewer checks a filed figure against BoG's own form.
!/docs/bog_returns/*_line_map.md
!/docs/bog_returns/00_full_return_registry.md
!/docs/bog_returns/99_coverage_matrix.md
!/docs/bog_returns/CONTRIBUTING_line_maps.md
!/docs/bog_returns/CONTRIBUTING_real_db_tests.md

# Methodology notes
!/docs/internal/credit_ratings_PD.md
!/docs/internal/forward_curve_construction.md
!/docs/research/*.md

# Audit package: only the sections carrying no tenant data, no infrastructure
# detail and no open-weakness inventory.
!/docs/audit/00_evidence_package_index.md
!/docs/audit/01_system_architecture.md
!/docs/audit/02_calculation_authority_registry.md
!/docs/audit/04_policy_governance.md
!/docs/audit/16_external_verification_schedule.md

# backend/docs/ is NOT covered by the rule above and is public by default. These
# carry real tenant identifiers, balances and open findings; ignore them here.
/backend/docs/INDEPENDENT_FORENSIC_REAUDIT_2026-08-22.md
/backend/docs/forensic_calculation_audit_2026-08-21.md
/backend/docs/P0_1_TO_P0_7_REMEDIATION_REPORT_2026-08-21.md
/backend/docs/bog_parameter_sources.md
